<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Sons of Gwalia half yr profit rises.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Sons of Gwalia half yr profit rises.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-02-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended December 31</p>
<p>		 (million A$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Operating profit		     32.70 vs 26.56</p>
<p>    Net					18.15 vs 16.64</p>
<p>    Dividend				 12.5  vs 12.5</p>
<p>NOTE: Sons of Gwalia Ltd is a Western Australian gold miner.  </p>
<p>    Sales			  157.63 vs 91.46</p>
<p>    Other income		   4.25 vs 2.38</p>
<p>    Abnormals			 nil vs nil</p>
<p>    Shr (cents)		   17.75 vs 23.23</p>
<p>    Tax			     12.69 vs 9.92</p>
<p>    Interest			 5.12 vs 1.66</p>
<p>    Depreciation		   5.74 vs 3.16</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 373 1800</p>
</text>
